# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Vittavani is a voice-first business assistant for small businesses, retail shops, wholesalers, distributors, and other inventory-based businesses.

Its central promise is:

**"Run your business by speaking naturally. Find stock, remember locations, record sales, track customer credit, and understand your business without complicated software."**

Brand:
- Product name: Vittavani
- Company attribution: A product of Vinayaka Services
- Temporary repository/project name may remain unchanged.
- Use Vittavani consistently in the visible application, browser title, PWA manifest, login screen, footer, and documentation.
- Do not invent a company address, registration number, support email, or legal claims.
- Do not spend time on domain purchases or trademark claims as part of implementation.

Primary audience:
- Indian small-business owners
- Shopkeepers with limited technical knowledge
- Wholesalers and distributors
- Users who prefer Hindi, Hinglish, or English
- Users who want to use speech instead of typing

Design principles:
- Mobile-first, especially Android phones
- Premium, modern, uncluttered SaaS interface
- Simple enough for a first-time software user
- Responsive on mobile, tablet, and desktop
- Accessible contrast, readable typography, large touch targets
- Indian currency formatting using INR
- Business timezone configurable, defaulting to Asia/Kolkata
- No fake statistics or hardcoded business data in production
- No decorative controls that do nothing

